 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hello! How have you been lately?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.46,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_18",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm fine, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.65,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is regifting ever okay?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.27,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It can be, if the gift is new, still in good shape, and actually suits the person you're giving it to.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.96,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg5",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I got a candle set that I",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "will honestly never use.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 2.76,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then it might be perfect for someone who loves candles. Just make sure they're not in the same friend group as the original giver.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 0.88,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg5",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, good point.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "And take off any old tags or cards. You'd be surprised how often those get forgotten.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "holiday_gifts.dlg5",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is there anything I should never regift?",
